      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Saskatoon has the lowest radon numbers of the four Prairie cities surveyed, but roughly 1 in 6 tested homes still came in at or above the guideline. The only way to know about yours is a long-term test in the basement you actually live in.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
